<title>UK: Jardine Intl Motor HK margins lower.</title>
<headline>Jardine Intl Motor HK margins lower.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Motor distributor Jardine International Motor Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday its Hong Kong operations had reduced margins in the first half, although unit sales increased.</p>
<p>&quot;A change in model mix has led to reduced margins resulting in a lower contribution,&quot; the company said in a statement released here from its annual meeting.</p>
<p>It added that a strong performance in Britain was being balanced by the depressed car market in France.</p>
<p>The company is part of the Jardine Matheson Holdings Ltd group. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
